        "&6/home &r- &aTeleport home"
        "&6/sethome &r- &aSet home location"
        "&6/delhome &r- &aDelete home location"
        "&6/tpa Player &r- &aRequest teleport to a player"
        "&6/nickname Name&r - &aSet nickname (supports special characters)"
        "&6/carryon clear&r - &aClear carried block/entity"
        ""
        "&7&oUsable without enabling cheats"
        "{@pagebreak}"
        "&d[FTB Teams Commands]"
        "&6/ftbteams party invite Player &r- &aInvite a player to your team"
        "&6/ftbteams party kick Player &r- &aKick a player from your team"
        "&6/ftbteams party leave &r- &aLeave current team"
        "&6/ftbteams party allies add Player&r- &aAdd a team ally"
        "&7(Note: Allies share FTB Chunks permissions, not quests)"
        "&6/ftbteams party transfer_ownership Player &r- &aTransfer ownership"
        ""
        "&7&oOffline servers must use commands"
    ]
