    quest.0BA8CFEBEE17A488.quest_desc: [
        " Some technologists and redstone engineers once visited the Twilight Forest and found that arsenic-lead-iron reactors could theoretically refine massive amounts of diamonds and gold, but might also connect to the Nether."
        " They secretly bred Ghasts atop the tower. Like many \"monster invasion\" stories, an experiment went wrong: a juvenile Ghast mutated into a giant, collapsing the tower and polluting the surrounding forest."
    ]
    quest.0BA8CFEBEE17A488.quest_subtitle: "A mutated Ghast leader born from a failed experiment — I do not believe killing it can stop the tower’s unspeakable doom."
    quest.0BA8CFEBEE17A488.title: "&4Above the Darkness"
    quest.0BB37F4D188BD287.title: "Observe: Snow Queen Trophy"
    quest.0BC716E3EFAB173E.quest_desc: [
        "&6Network Music Player&r can turn &2free&4 NetEase Cloud Music&r tracks into music discs."
        ""
        "step1: Open &4NetEase Cloud Music Web&f and find a free song you like"
        ""
        "step2: Open the song page and find the number after &eid=xxxx&r in the URL"
        ""
        "step3: Copy the number and return to the game to open the &dMusic Recorder"
        ""
        "step4: Paste the number into the ID field and place the disc in the right slot"
        ""
        "step5: Click Create Disc, then insert it into a &6Jukebox&r to play"
    ]
    quest.0BC716E3EFAB173E.quest_subtitle: "Burn NetEase Cloud Music"
    quest.0BCEE748756B8A82.quest_desc: [
        "Dark Forest - Singer: Yunyi Xingchen"
        "Leaving no wandering trace"
        "Like a ghostly breath, hiding, watching"
        "Hunter and prey, one and the same"
        "The different are enemies"
        "Destruction as praise, supreme affirmation"
        "Ah, look"
        "That foolish child lights a fire"
        "Ah, look"
        "That foolish child waves and says"
        "I am here"
        "I call out sincerely"
        "I am here"
        "In this empty universe"
        "Who opens their eyes to see me"
        "I am here"
        "I am here"
        "So-called morality and ethics"
        "Sorry, I can only restrain myself"
        "What is civilization? Guns and attacks replace love"
        "Fallen — me and you"
        "No one can see clearly"
        "Time accompanies in silence, cold and merciless"
        "Ah, look"
        "The endless cycle of suspicion"
        "Ah, look"
        "Killing begins without hesitation"
        "Dark Forest"
        "This eternal truth"
        "Dark Forest"
        "No light can descend"
        "Embrace all life"
        "Dark Forest"
        "Dark Forest"
        "This eternal truth"
        "Dark Forest"
        "No light can descend"
        "Embrace all life"
