    quest.196959C6E061913D.quest_desc: [
        "&l&d\"Obsidian Monolith\""
        "&6Health: &a1200"
        "&6Attack: &c64"
        "&6Armor: &714"
        ""
        "&l&dSpawn"
        "&6Appears on &bObsidian Sky Islands&6 in the End."
        "&6Place an &eEye of Ender&6 on the &eObsidian Altar&6 at the top,"
        "&6wait briefly, and it will emerge from underground."
        "&6Use &eSulfur Nectar&6 to reset the arena."
        ""
        "&9Structure Compass: &b【Phantasmal Chaos】Obsidian Sky Island&r"
        "{@pagebreak}"
        "&l&dGuide"
        "&cBring a Netherite Pickaxe with Efficiency V."
        "It has four phases. Each phase summons Obsidian Runes and becomes invincible."
        "Destroy all Obsidian Runes. They have the same hardness as normal obsidian."
        "After all runes are destroyed, invincibility is removed."
        ""
        "&l&dSkills"
        "&l&eFlame Spikes"
        "Red runes glow, marking spike zones on the ground."
        "After charging, spikes erupt, dealing 64 damage and setting targets on fire."
        "&l&eFrost Spikes"
        "Blue runes glow, marking spike zones under targets."
        "After charging, spikes deal 64 damage and apply Slowness III for 5 seconds."
        "{@pagebreak}"
        "&l&eGuardian Spikes"
        "Yellow runes glow, creating warning spikes around itself."
        "After charging, spikes deal 16 damage and knock back targets."
        "&l&eCataclysmic Starfall"
        "Purple runes glow, marking impact zones under targets."
        "After charging, it leaps and crashes, causing an explosion."
        ""
        "&o&7Guide source: www.mcmod.cn"
    ]
