quest.1B5B7580815E49B0.quest_desc: ["When holding wool, it will actively follow you. Right-click to give it wool of different colors or drop it on the ground to pick it up. Each color lengthens its body and emits particles matching the wool's color, with corresponding wool on its body. After collecting all sixteen vanilla wool colors, it emits particles of all given colors and drops a Puzzle Sheep loot, Horn of Dissolution, Iron Ingot, Gold Ingot, Lapis Lazuli, Diamond, and Emerald, one of each."]
quest.1B5B7580815E49B0.quest_subtitle: "It seems to want to trade with me"
quest.1B5B7580815E49B0.title: "&5Strange Sheep"
quest.1BC6ADF60CE0E739.quest_desc: [
    "&aObjective: Reach Origin Island"
    ""
    "&6In the vast ocean lies a long-lost island,"
    "&6its sole resident is &aLost Soul&6, an early form of Magic Pet."
    "&6Lost Soul can be bottled with an &eEmpty Bottle&6 and used in the &eMagic Pet Ritual&6."
