quest.21E6DAFDF89BABEF.quest_desc: [
    "&b&lBeyond Dimension:&r"
    ""
    "&bBeyond Dimension&r is a mod providing storage space."
    ""
    "It introduces a virtual storage system — &bDimension Network&r."
    ""
    "This network does not rely on any blocks or items,"
    ""
    "You can access it anytime using &d【O】&r."
    "{@pagebreak}"
    "&2&lIngenious Backpack:&r"
    ""
    "&2Ingenious Backpack&r is an upgradable backpack."
    ""
    "Can be worn in &bChest Slot&r or &bBack Slot in Accessory Inventory&r."
    ""
    "Default open with &d【B】&r, sort with &d【Middle Mouse】&r."
    ""
    "Left: &6Upgrade Tab&r to install &6Backpack Upgrades&r for special functions."
    ""
    "Right: &6Backpack Settings&r to configure special functions."
    ""
    "{@pagebreak}"
    "&9&lIngenious Storage:&r"
    ""
    "Barrels have larger storage and more functions."
    ""
    "Greatly reduces storage network footprint,"
    ""
    "At max upgrade, a single barrel can solve everything."
]
quest.21E6DAFDF89BABEF.quest_subtitle: "Too much stuff? This chapter solves your problem!"
quest.21E6DAFDF89BABEF.title: "Side Quest: Backpack & Storage"
quest.21F9F82D260D81BD.quest_desc: [
    "On my journey, I saw a serpentine giant trapped in a decorated 'courtyard.' I picked up a worn feather, ignoring the green scales."
    "These green scales contained the magic property I needed to break curses, but too weak. I needed to kill the serpentine giant directly to obtain fresher samples."
]
