quest.293872FA6D26833A.quest_desc: [
    "To summon the Maid, prepare the following minerals:"
    "&6&lLapis Lazuli, Diamond, Gold Ingot, Redstone, Iron Ingot, Coal."
    "Facing the altar door, right-click the top of the altar pillar,"
    "&aPlace in order from left to right&r as above."
