    quest.2FB59F656446274D.quest_desc: [
        "&6Sneak + Right-click while empty-handed to bind to the current player's dimension network. Dimension network admins can sneak + right-click empty-handed to unbind."
        ""
        "&6Using a Network Interface is the most convenient way to input and output items in the mod."
        ""
        "&6Network Interfaces have 9 marked slots and 9 storage slots. They can input/output using pipes from other mods and can store any resource type that the dimension network can store. When broken, they drop a Compact Matter Sphere containing their contents, along with the block itself."
        ""
        "&6Every 9 ticks, the Network Interface performs the following operations in order:"
        ""
               "&6Deposits items from storage slots into the dimension network, unless the item is marked in the corresponding slot."
        ""
        "&6Extracts marked items from the dimension network into the corresponding slots."
        ""
        "&6If Eject Mode is enabled, ejects marked items into valid adjacent blocks."
    ]
