    quest.38F2CD611DFF78EA.quest_desc: ["&6Shift + Right-click to open the ledger and view today's income. Click the ledger cover to enter the menu interface. Place &eat least one dish and one drink &rinto the corresponding menu slots respectively (Left-click to select and move to the right column, left-click again to place, right-click to clear). After binding to a table, you can start operating on the ledger page~&r&r"]
