    quest.3A606C2453D06AFF.title: "Familiar Ritual"
    quest.3AA1AA79BED0F294.quest_desc: [
        "&aExchange: Heaven's Gift + Spin to Win = Aether Dragon Soul"
        ""
        "&eThe Inheritance Grounds &6hold the precious legacy left by ancient dragons."
        "&6There are two types of Inheritance Grounds, the second being an &eInheritance Temple &6made of End Stone."
        "&6In the past, ancient dragons taught young dragons the magic of flight and spin here."
        "&6Now, these inheritances are useless, you can exchange them for &dAether Dragon Soul&6."
        ""
        ""
        "{image:kubejs:textures/task/treasure_end_2.png width:192 height:108 align:center}"
    ]
    quest.3AA1AA79BED0F294.title: "Skill Empowerment"
    quest.3AF8293458FE7927.quest_desc: [
        "Make a 2×2 small pool of water, surround it with plants, and then throw a diamond into the pool. Watch as a bolt of lightning strikes, and the portal to the Twilight Forest will open!"
        "Now, you can also activate the Twilight Forest portal using a Dragon Egg!"
        ""
        "&7&oNote: This chapter was written by linxi2259"
    ]
    quest.3AF8293458FE7927.quest_subtitle: "A forest world shrouded in eternal twilight"
    quest.3AF8293458FE7927.title: "&3&lMain Quest: Twilight Forest"
    quest.3B02DF458924B95C.quest_desc: [
        "&l&d「Void Bloom」"
        "&6Health: &a1400"
        "&6Attack: &c48"
        "&6Armor: &74"
        ""
        "&l&dSpawn"
        "&6Dwelling deep at the bottom of the world, the &eVoid Lily &6will guide players to its lair."
        "&6No summoning is needed; it spawns when a player approaches the &bVoid Bloom Cavern&6."
        "&6You can use &eSulfur Nectar &6to reset the boss arena."
        ""
        "&9Structure Compass: &b【Cataclysm】Void Bloom Cavern&r"
        "{@pagebreak}"
        "&l&dStrategy"
        "Being too close to the Void Bloom continuously deals 48 points of Thorns damage."
        "Performing melee attacks on the Void Bloom inflicts 48 Thorns damage."
        "When its health drops to a threshold for phase transition, the Void Bloom attempts to summon several small Void Blooms around the arena."
        "While the small Void Blooms exist, the main Void Bloom regenerates health very quickly, but cannot heal past the previous phase."
        "Players must destroy all small Void Blooms to continue the normal challenge, similar to the Ender Crystal for the Ender Dragon."
        ""
        "&l&dSkills"
        "&l&eThorn Spike"
        "The Void Bloom burrows into the ground for a short distance, then summons three thorn spikes in succession at the player's location, each dealing 48 damage on hit."
        "{@pagebreak}"
        "&l&ePincushion Paradise"
        "The Void Bloom points its crown upward, spins, and drills into the ground, then releases thorn spikes covering the entire arena in three waves, dealing 48 damage per hit."
        "&l&eToxin Bomb"
        "The Void Bloom folds its petals and fires a green toxin bomb at the player. The bomb deals 48 damage on direct hit. After a while, the bomb explodes, and poisonous thorns extend over a large surrounding area, dealing 48 damage on hit and inflicting Poison I for 6 seconds."
        "&l&ePetal Dance"
        "The Void Bloom twists its body, firing petals at the player three times, each hit dealing 48 damage."
        ""
        "&o&7Strategy Source: www.mcmod.cn"
    ]
    quest.3B02DF458924B95C.quest_subtitle: "★★★"
    quest.3B02DF458924B95C.title: "Cataclysm: Void Bloom"
