    quest.3E5F53B92682C2E2.quest_desc: [
        "&6In the Starlight dimension, there is a mysterious Cursed Garden. Stepping inside, danger looms instantly. It is filled with plants carrying the Curse of Vanishing; touching them makes items disappear instantly. There are also thorns with the Curse of Binding; once entangled, it's hard to break free unless you die or the item is damaged. Only the brave can explore its secrets."
        ""
        "&9Structure Compass: &b【Eternal Starlight】Cursed Garden"
    ]
    quest.3E5F53B92682C2E2.quest_subtitle: "Prepare and wear at least one piece of Thermal Springstone armor. Only fire can destroy the giant plants dwelling here."
