    quest.44CE0CDA182CFC61.quest_desc: [
        "&aObjective: Mine Dread Rot Ore to obtain Rotbane Clumps"
        ""
        "&6Eating &eRotbane Clumps &6can completely clear &eRot Infection&6."
        "&6Eating &eRotbane Nodules &6can reduce &eRot Infection&6."
        "&eDread Rot Ore &6generates in The Undergarden at Y-levels below 0."
        "&6Additionally, &eRotbane Clumps &6can be used for &eInfusion&6."
