    quest.4A5D5042C28278A2.quest_desc: [
        "&6Right-click to create a dimension network."
        ""
        "&6To share the same network with friends, simply craft a &bMember Inviter&6, right-click to bind it to your network, and then throw it to your friend to use. This allows your friend to access your dimension network but without permission to bind your network to other items or blocks. You can also make a &aNetwork Controller &6to grant them higher permissions, or use a &cAdmin Member Inviter &6to invite them. If you wish to share network storage without sharing the same network, you can give them a bound &dNetwork Terminal."
    ]
    quest.4A5D5042C28278A2.quest_subtitle: "&8If you don't understand something, press B while hovering over the item to jump to the wiki page."
